      "dignitaries": "Fatima Natyrbova (Sheretlukova)",
      "dignitaryBorn": "1890",
      "dignitaryDied": "1983",
      "notes": "Participated in the Circassian charity evening in Ekaterinodar in 1908 and got indroduced to her future husband Kutchuk Natyrbov and got married in 1909. In 1919 they moved to the Ottman Empire and she established there The Circassian woman Committee and helped refugees. She moved with her husband, 4 children, and two sisters to USA in 1923 and kept her activism for the circassian till she passed away.",
